<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>Criminality</Major>
    <Description>This macro for Roblox Criminality perfectly compensates for the AKS74u recoil. The macro SHOULD be used on run while holding key, but you can use default settings if you feel like it. The sensitiivity for this macro is 800 dpi and .171 sensitivity in roblox. The macro was made on 1920x1080p, so for the best results you SHOULD use it on that resolution, but you can use other resolutions such as 800x600p. Even though this macro does compensate for the recoil, that does not mean you will be lasering people from 500 studs. At some point you have to aim on your own.</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
